{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Pre-sweep against origin/main 7927904a0 before spending a gate slot. Every load-bearing number in this plan was re-measured from the tree rather than sampled, by listing tests/unit/ at depth 1 and AST-diffing each pair's top-level definitions.\n\nConfirmed correct and unchanged:\n- 39 base/_heldout pairs directly under tests/unit/. The directory holds 815 root modules and 53 _heldout modules, of which exactly 39 have a base twin and 14 are unpaired (the unpaired ones are S5's, as AC1 already says).\n- Exactly one colliding test-function name across all 39 pairs, and it is the one the plan names: test_plan_material_pin_config.py::test_unreadable_optional_config_warns_structurally_and_returns_false.\n- The held-out pin_config twin is 24 LOC with that single test at :11, and the base carries the same test at :20-31. Deleting the twin whole is correct.\n- Exactly 8 pairs carry non-test definitions with differing bodies.\n- tests/unit/test_audit_serve.py::_clean_ui_env is base-only, at :27, as AC3's parenthetical states.\n\nTwo corrections applied:\n1. The Approach said '9 renames'. That conflated pairs with renames: the 8 differing pairs carry 12 differing definitions, and the ninth item is a file deletion, not a rename. The Approach now states 12 definition renames over 8 pairs plus one whole-file deletion, and enumerates all 12 by name and module, so the implementer does not have to re-derive the set.\n2. The measurement pin said 'Cites are on origin/main 083620b0', which is several commits stale. Repinned to 7927904a0 with the method recorded, so a later reviewer can tell a re-measurement from a sample.\n\nThe blocking preconditions in the Context paragraph are now satisfied: this ticket's blocked_by set is empty, so the test-suite epic's last story and the tests/-editing code epics have closed."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793478441271003001,"uuid":"02be0315-2d51-4ecb-9e8d-46ab7187cc87"}